OL,3,GNEWSANew kidney research could have
OL,4,Aglobal implications
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "first-of-its-kind" study has found
OL,7,Fdialysis should not be the default
OL,8,Ftreatment option for older people with
OL,9,Fkidney failure.
OL,11,FThe research, led by the University of
OL,12,FBristol, found that managing symptoms
OL,13,Fin a less medicalised way may offer an
OL,14,Falternative without compromising a
OL,15,Fperson's quality and length of life.
OL,17,FDialysis is a medical treatment that
OL,18,Fcleans a person's blood when they are
OL,19,Fexperiencing kidney failure, but it
OL,20,Foften means spending hours in hospital
OL,21,Fevery week and it carries risks of
OL,22,Fcomplications.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
