OL,3,GNEWSANew kidney research could have
OL,4,Aglobal implications
OL,5,
OL,6,FProject lead professor Fergus Caskey
OL,7,Fsaid: "Our findings could have global
OL,8,Fimplications for how kidney failure is
OL,9,Fdiscussed and managed in older
OL,10,Fpatients."
